The pressure screams against your hull, but you snag the object. It's a 'Black Box' from Ark Mission 12. The audio log is terrifying\: 'The clouds... they aren't clouds. They are billions of microscopic machines eating the ship.' #line:singing_storm_drone_success_00
-> Continue #line:singing_storm_drone_success_01
    <<give_item item_ancient_data_log 1>>
    <<reveal_clue clue_ark_mission_12>>
