title: singing_storm_fail_dive
tags: 
---
Turbulence slams your ship against a pocket of metallic hydrogen. You are forced to emergency ascend before the hull buckles. You lost the signal. #line:singing_storm_fail_dive_00
-> Continue #line:singing_storm_fail_dive_01
    <<damage_ship 20>>
    <<stop>>
===

